waiver: harness-limit
reason: the wasm leg runs the core module under a bare `wasmtime run`, which
  defines neither the wasi:sockets imports std/fetch brings in, so the module
  does not instantiate, nor a preopened directory for read_file to fail in
  with NotFound. TestWASMStdError covers a concrete error boxed into
  `dyn error.Error` on wasm, and TestWasmIoErrorOtherText* the runtime's
  IoError text with a directory mounted.
